# XLSX due-diligence packet reconciliation.
# This is intentionally source-readable by business reviewers.

Read XLSX cell "Summary!B2" as site name
Read XLSX cell "Summary!B3" as site address
Read XLSX cell "Summary!B4" as credit value
Read XLSX cell "Summary!B5" as placed in service date

Read XLSX cell "Legal!B2" as legal site name
Read XLSX cell "Legal!B3" as legal address
Read XLSX cell "PPA!B2" as ppa site name
Read XLSX cell "PPA!B3" as ppa address

Read XLSX cell "Cost Seg!B6" as cost seg asset total
Read XLSX cell "Cost Seg!B8" as eligible basis
Read XLSX cell "Cost Seg!B9" as calculated credit value

Read XLSX cell "Domestic Content!C5" as domestic content affidavit
Read XLSX cell "Domestic Content!C8" as steel origin status
Read XLSX cell "Payroll!D12" as prevailing wage status
Read XLSX cell "Equipment!E15" as usa equipment count
Read XLSX cell "Equipment!E16" as total equipment count
Read XLSX cell "Controls!B2" as formula health check

Read XLSX cell "Documents!C2" as form status
Read XLSX cell "Documents!C3" as ppa status
Read XLSX cell "Documents!C4" as land lease status
Read XLSX cell "Documents!C5" as cost seg report status
Read XLSX cell "Documents!C6" as domestic content status
Read XLSX cell "Documents!C7" as payroll status

Expect site name is present as "summary-site-name-present"
Expect site address is present as "summary-site-address-present"
Expect legal site name equals site name as "legal-site-name-matches-summary"
Expect ppa site name equals site name as "ppa-site-name-matches-summary"
Expect legal address equals site address as "legal-address-matches-summary"
Expect ppa address equals site address as "ppa-address-matches-summary"
Expect credit value equals 250000 as "credit-value-expected"
Expect cost seg asset total equals 337500 as "cost-seg-total-expected"
Expect calculated credit value equals credit value as "calculated-credit-matches-summary"
Expect placed in service date is present as "placed-in-service-date-present"
Expect domestic content affidavit is present as "domestic-content-affidavit-present"
Expect steel origin status equals "US-sourced steel documented" as "steel-origin-status"
Expect prevailing wage status equals "Certified payroll package complete" as "prevailing-wage-certified"
Expect usa equipment count equals 18 as "usa-equipment-count"
Expect total equipment count equals usa equipment count as "all-equipment-made-in-usa"
Expect formula health check is not spreadsheet error as "formula-health-no-error"
Expect form status equals "Present" as "irs-form-present"
Expect ppa status equals "Present" as "ppa-present"
Expect land lease status equals "Present" as "land-lease-present"
Expect cost seg report status equals "Present" as "cost-seg-report-present"
Expect domestic content status equals "Present" as "domestic-content-package-present"
Expect payroll status equals "Present" as "payroll-package-present"

Export assertions to assertion report path
